.TH KUMDE-MSG 1 "2026" "kumde 0.8.0" "KumDE Manual"
.SH NAME
kumde-msg \- send commands to a running kumde compositor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kumde-msg
.I command
[args]
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B workspace \fIn\fR
Switch focused output to workspace N (1\-9).
.TP
.B move-to \fIn\fR
Move focused window to workspace N.
.TP
.B close
Close the focused window.
.TP
.B layout tile|float|monocle
Set the layout on the focused output.
.TP
.B quit
Quit kumde.
.TP
.B reload
Reload configuration (same as SIGHUP).
.TP
.B subscribe
Stream IPC events to stdout until interrupted.
.TP
.B notify \fIapp\fR \fIsummary\fR [\fIbody\fR] [\fIurgency\fR] [\fItimeout_ms\fR]
Send a notification to kumnotify.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B KUMDE_IPC
Path to the kumde IPC socket. Set automatically by kumde.
.TP
.B KUMNOTIFY_SOCK
Path to the kumnotify socket. Set automatically by kumnotify.
